{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"LEV","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"利未記","commonName":"利未記","title":"利未記","order":3,"numberOfChapters":27,"sha256":"7ef7fe3d48f7fd220ad5bf6e3ffe06ef19daec3d96e187352fb24c51eb9822ea","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LEV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":27,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LEV/27.json","totalNumberOfVerses":858},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["產婦潔淨禮的條例"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對摩西說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你曉諭以色列人說：若有婦人懷孕生男孩，她就不潔淨七天，像在月經污穢的日子不潔淨一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["第八天，要給嬰孩行割禮。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["婦人在產血不潔之中，要家居三十三天。她潔淨的日子未滿，不可摸聖物，也不可進入聖所。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["她若生女孩，就不潔淨兩個七天，像污穢的時候一樣，要在產血不潔之中，家居六十六天。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["「滿了潔淨的日子，無論是為男孩是為女孩，她要把一歲的羊羔為燔祭，一隻雛鴿或是一隻斑鳩為贖罪祭，帶到會幕門口交給祭司。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["祭司要獻在耶和華面前，為她贖罪，她的血源就潔淨了。這條例是為生育的婦人，無論是生男生女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["她的力量若不夠獻一隻羊羔，她就要取兩隻斑鳩或是兩隻雛鴿，一隻為燔祭，一隻為贖罪祭。祭司要為她贖罪，她就潔淨了。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LEV/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LEV/13.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/LEV/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}